{"version":1,"content":"<p>荷里活歌影視天后珍妮花露柏絲（Jennifer Lopez）雖然已57歲，但一直保養得超好。</p><p>雖然於「賭城」拉斯維加斯一酒店舉行的「駐場騷」已結束，但珍妮花仍然不敢怠慢繼續做gym積極操fit，希望以最佳狀態示人。</p><p>&lt;br/&gt;&lt;</p>","scraped_at":"2026-11-15T01:13:19.210252+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":114,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-15T01:01:57+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-15T01:06:29.374884+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-15T01:06:29.374884+00:00","content_hash":"66bc2593c9754644cc764edcb534b78717a06b56a5ec2b1d8d877d8e6e38eaa7","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}